    {
      "nickname": "Walmart customer",
      "created_at": "2024-07-21",
      "rating": 5,
      "headline": null,
      "comments": "I ride 50+ miles and the glasses can get a bit heavy on your face, and I'm hoping the second and third generation will be a little lighter. Other than that, I think these are amazing.",
      "source": "openai"
    },
    {
      "nickname": "Rajesh",
      "created_at": "2024-03-24",
      "rating": 4,
      "headline": null,
      "comments": "Easy to click photos and videos which I use it mainly outdoor. Transferring is not a big challenge. I posted few videos in insta with #metaview. You can also check insta in @carajeshpb. Only challenge I face is that should be a feature to change lens from sunglass to reading glass as it is difficult to take photos or videos with the sunglass wearing that after evening!",
      "source": "openai"
    },
    {
      "nickname": "Grace",
      "created_at": "2024-01-10",
      "rating": 5,
      "headline": null,
      "comments": "My husband is an ultra runner, and he captures great footage on mountain terrain. He wasn't sold at the thought of the glasses, but when he tried them, he was blown away. The footage is so clear, responsive and stable. Hands down one of the best gifts I've ever given him.",
      "source": "openai"
    },
    {
      "nickname": "jaime",
      "created_at": "2023-12-08",
      "rating": 1,
      "headline": null,
      "comments": "Not as good as the last version. I had the original version so my expectations were very high because that was a great product. The phone quality is terrible. There's a huge blinking light now when recording. The go live feature is good but the upload video quality is not. Definitely want to return and get the old Rayna stories back.",
      "source": "openai"
    },
    {
      "nickname": "Jure",
      "created_at": "2023-11-23",
      "rating": 5,
      "headline": null,
      "comments": "Stylish, you wouldn't tell it contains any tech how slim or how identical to regular Ray-Bans it look like. Only problem is comfort on the nose, after 1h of wearing it leaves a bit of red marks on the skin. Camera works like a charm, no more need to pull up your smartphone to take a picture or a video. Also much safer and easier to use in all situations.",
      "source": "openai"
    }
  ],
